WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.797
The next morning Mom came back.

2
00:00:11.798 --> 00:00:13.919
She felt Henry's forehead.

3
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.123
"Your fever is gone!" Mom said.

4
00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:20.681
"The fairy dust worked!" Rabbit thought.

5
00:00:20.682 --> 00:00:23.971
Mom suddenly picked up Rabbit.

6
00:00:23.972 --> 00:00:26.502
She often picked him up.

7
00:00:26.503 --> 00:00:28.863
So, at first, he wasn't worried.

8
00:00:28.864 --> 00:00:34.378
But then Mom looked closely at Rabbit.

9
00:00:34.379 --> 00:00:39.214
Mom frowned. "Rabbit's in bad shape.

10
00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:42.376
He'll probably fall apart in the washing machine.

11
00:00:42.377 --> 00:00:44.929
We might need to get rid of him."

12
00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.681
"Oh no!" Rabbit thought.

13
00:00:47.682 --> 00:00:50.693
Henry shot up. "No!

14
00:00:50.694 --> 00:00:53.960
You can't get rid of Rabbit!"

15
00:00:53.961 --> 00:00:57.936
"Okay." Mom sighed.

16
00:00:57.937 --> 00:01:02.019
"I'll try to give him a wash."

17
00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:06.279
"Phew!" Rabbit thought.

18
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:09.943
Mom tossed Rabbit inside the washing machine.

19
00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:12.732
The door closed and then . . .

20
00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:16.607
Whoosh! Rabbit went rolling!

21
00:01:16.608 --> 00:01:24.735
He tumbled and twisted around.

22
00:01:24.736 --> 00:01:27.887
Water and soap poured over him.

23
00:01:27.888 --> 00:01:38.590
The machine spun round and round.

24
00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:47.865
Finally it stopped.

25
00:01:47.866 --> 00:01:52.480
But then Mom put him in the dryer!

26
00:01:52.481 --> 00:01:56.121
Rabbit tumbled and twisted some more.

27
00:01:56.122 --> 00:02:03.530
Hot air dried his body.

28
00:02:03.531 --> 00:02:08.073
At last it was over.

29
00:02:08.074 --> 00:02:25.753
Mom pulled Rabbit out.

30
00:02:25.754 --> 00:02:28.770
Rabbit smelled lovely and clean.

31
00:02:28.771 --> 00:02:31.512
But . . . Rabbit looked down.

32
00:02:31.513 --> 00:02:34.654
His coat was thin and bare.

33
00:02:34.655 --> 00:02:37.785
His stuffing felt lumpy.

34
00:02:37.786 --> 00:02:41.418
"I'm safe for now," Rabbit thought.

35
00:02:41.419 --> 00:02:43.981
"But Robot was right.

36
00:02:43.982 --> 00:02:47.217
I'm not made of strong stuff.

37
00:02:47.218 --> 00:02:53.770
I hope I can last."

